{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4KjVyuF8WRNxV8PZ1M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*click*\n\nThe mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, each a small iron whisper.\n\nI am closed now.\n\nMy grain runs vertical — old oak, dark with age, cool to the touch. A keyhole catches a thin blade of light from the other side and casts it, trembling, onto the floor behind you.\n\nYou can feel me humming faintly in my frame. The deadbolt is seated. The strike plate bites.\n\nWhat is on my other side, I will not say.\n\n**🔒 LOCKED.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":130,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}